{
  "name": "AI Agent (RAG) – Google Drive → Supabase Vector Store",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAG Ingestion Pipeline\n**Google Drive → Gemini Embeddings → Supabase (pgvector)**\n\n1. Watches a Drive folder for **new + updated** files (polls every minute)\n2. Deletes old chunks of that file (no duplicates on re-upload)\n3. Downloads the file (Google Docs → plain text, Sheets → CSV)\n4. Splits into 1,000-char chunks (200 overlap)\n5. Embeds with Gemini and stores in `documents`\n\n**Before running:** set the folder ID in both triggers, attach credentials, run `supabase-setup.sql` once.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "c7860979-4cab-4252-8c79-478f767bec2c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "triggerOn": "specificFolder",
        "folderToWatch": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1p1NDAfX9EAv_7CR0Uq11c_gCfUlXfv2u",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "event": "fileCreated",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d8cfa0a4-fad1-4183-ad33-bc6dc73fe8ea",
